    "title": "Independence, Jackson, and Stone counties awarded transportation grants - NewsBreak",
    "text": "whiterivernow.com\nwebsite\nIndependence County, Arkansas\nIndependence, Jackson, and Stone counties awarded transportation grants\nBy White River Now,\n58 minutes agoThree north-central Arkansas counties are among the recipients of funding from the Arkansas Department of Transportation’s 2025 Transportation Alternatives Program. Independence County received $500,000 for the Batesville Greenway Trail Addition, Jackson County was awarded $500,000 for the Sydney Sutherland Memorial Walking Trail for the Jackson County School District, and Stone County was granted $500,000 for the first phase of sidewalks along Highway 5.\n1",
